<title>GERMANY: MAN says expects good results in 1996/97.</title>
<headline>MAN says expects good results in 1996/97.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>German engineering group MAN AG said on Tuesday that it expected another round of good results in its 1996/97 business year ending June 30 and for higher productivity.</p>
<p>MAN also said that incoming orders for the period from July to September rose two percent to 5.4 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
